 to represent what it does better. r=jgilbert, a=gchang\n\nWe only pay attention to the flag for images.", "files": ["dom/canvas/CanvasRenderingContext2D.cpp", "dom/canvas/ImageBitmap.cpp", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.cpp", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a505776470f39e6d158798e5bf866c8d0abf0baa", "parents": ["f9bc084fbb8aa55c789bb954d2fab951faeccf6b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1355898 - Use the first frame of animated images for texImage2d. r=jgilbert, a=gchang\n\nThe spec for canvas drawImage says to use the first frame. I can't find anything spec related at all referencing the issue for webgl (except bug 666855). So do the same as drawImage.", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLTextureUpload.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "46c09c592d8a3fdb0ddff74d12cbc7c3973810af", "parents": ["a505776470f39e6d158798e5bf866c8d0abf0baa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1355898 - Add crashtest. a=gchang", "files": ["image/test/crashtests/1355898-1.html", "image/test/crashtests/crashtests.list"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a09f9a680f647cf918d6a79537914f12d8dfd716", "parents": ["46c09c592d8a3fdb0ddff74d12cbc7c3973810af"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Chronopoulos \u003cachronop@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1359477 - Uplift cubeb patch 7a4c711. r=kinetik, a=gchang", "files": ["media/libcubeb/src/cubeb_audiounit.cpp", "media/libcubeb/update.sh", "media/libcubeb/uplift-patch-7a4c711.patch"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9b70b5b852e49517374e038955271aed29251d46", "parents": ["a09f9a680f647cf918d6a79537914f12d8dfd716"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan Beich \u003cjbeich@FreeBSD.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1375198 - FreeBSD bootstrap: drop explicit dependency on libGL. r=rillian, a=gchang\n\nlibGL package was consolidated into mesa-libs but quarterly set still\nuses the old name. Since gtk3 (via libepoxy) and gtk2 (via cairo)\nalready indirectly depend on mesa-libs take advantage of it to avoid\nchurn on updates.\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: F5LBOOthAMc", "files": ["python/mozboot/mozboot/freebsd.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3084910eaad3626a6192d35aa3f27254ccb53326", "parents": ["9b70b5b852e49517374e038955271aed29251d46"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1366903 - Fix decompilation of JSOP_REGEXP and JSOP_NEWARRAY_COPYONWRITE. r=nbp a=jcristau", "files": ["js/src/jsopcode.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6785c2a852da973b72b5134edd6dd1b84c65c843", "parents": ["3084910eaad3626a6192d35aa3f27254ccb53326"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1368105 - Check for undepended strings in JSDependentString::baseOffset. r=luke, a=abillings", "files": ["js/src/vm/String-inl.h", "js/src/vm/String.cpp", "js/src/vm/String.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "11c8e23f0fd7bd83fe29d70c4cb8a5f21f01aa8d", "parents": ["6785c2a852da973b72b5134edd6dd1b84c65c843"], "tags": []}], "date": 1499702872, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "7201": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-302 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7b61dfbee16e2a8903f7c7fed64bd1630bb7973c", "parents": ["11c8e23f0fd7bd83fe29d70c4cb8a5f21f01aa8d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HPKP preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-302 - a=hpkp-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ad44477564e02b544a8a7c5360394a263e3b9169", "parents": ["7b61dfbee16e2a8903f7c7fed64bd1630bb7973c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1499703107, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "7202": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Backed out 3 changesets (bug 1355898) for Linux32 assertions in image/test/crashtests/delayedframe.sjs.\n\nBacked out changeset a09f9a680f64 (bug 1355898)\nBacked out changeset 46c09c592d8a (bug 1355898)\nBacked out changeset a505776470f3 (bug 1355898)", "files": ["dom/canvas/CanvasRenderingContext2D.cpp", "dom/canvas/ImageBitmap.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLTextureUpload.cpp", "image/test/crashtests/1355898-1.html", "image/test/crashtests/crashtests.list", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.cpp", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e21dc2356baaa509ffe06b32c86832972013fa6e", "parents": ["ad44477564e02b544a8a7c5360394a263e3b9169"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Joel Maher \u003cjmaher@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1308343 - Intermittent browser/modules/test/browser/browser_ContentSearch.js. temporarily disable. r=gbrown, a=test-only\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 1tvAPxjIZ0J", "files": ["browser/modules/test/browser.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "504c4ac454f968928de28d85fde6e0a5bfdb1c48", "parents": ["e21dc2356baaa509ffe06b32c86832972013fa6e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kevin Chen \u003ckechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1355168 - Ensure mTarget in CanvasRendering2D::DrawWindow. r=mats, a=ritu", "files": ["dom/canvas/CanvasRenderingContext2D.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f45ba43512ad8c6d85e3f55b3fec9285128c4c13", "parents": ["504c4ac454f968928de28d85fde6e0a5bfdb1c48"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matt Howell \u003cmhowell@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1375472 - Use an optimized build of the 7-zip SFX stub. r=rstrong, a=ritu\n\nBug 1361326 required rebuilding the 7-zip self-extractor executable, which is\nstored in binary form in the tree. I accidentally built that binary with all\ncompiler optimizations disabled. This binary is built from identical code as\nthe one from bug 1361326, the only difference is this one was built with /O2\ninstead of /Od.\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: L07EXZoQEa7", "files": ["other-licenses/7zstub/firefox/7zSD.sfx"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b3a2ee816410404dbe68bd3430cf2493e13b2f3a", "parents": ["f45ba43512ad8c6d85e3f55b3fec9285128c4c13"], "tags": []}], "date": 1499717553, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "7203": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-303 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "78f05220899f82b4ea012915662110901c2e1704", "parents": ["b3a2ee816410404dbe68bd3430cf2493e13b2f3a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HPKP preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-303 - a=hpkp-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f0f089ac35c740d4b53e3cb02561403a7e9a45d0", "parents": ["78f05220899f82b4ea012915662110901c2e1704"], "tags": []}], "date": 1499788695, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "7204": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Conley \u003cmconley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1308820 - Make sure to close the print progress dialog if print preview is exited. r=Gijs, a=gchang\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 391bf9J2Qcf", "files": ["toolkit/components/printing/content/printUtils.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e9a10